+# S5-CLM-00003495 — `maximalLength_pow`
+
+This directory is the complete target-local diagnostic handoff for the frozen
+FC-SORRY declaration `Arxiv.«1609.08688».maximalLength_pow`.
+
+- `Statement.lean` preserves the exact formal proposition and supplies
+  bidirectional identity transports.
+- `Proof.lean` proves the valid eventual-to-unbounded implication and a strict
+  logical separation of those quantifiers.
+- `Audit.lean` executes exact-type probes and prints the local axiom census.
+- The JSON and Markdown artifacts bind identity, provenance, source anchors,
+  the typed cut DAG, readable reconstruction, cold validation, and the
+  readable frontier, cold validation, and the provisional release decision.
+
+The source paper proves arbitrarily large product-power witnesses, while the
+frozen Lean declaration asks for the bound at every sufficiently large index.
+No exact root for that stronger proposition is supplied by the source.  This
+handoff therefore leaves theorem completion false and waits for canonical
+Master review; it neither weakens the frozen type nor imports the provider's
+placeholder-dependent body.
